          },
          "code": "PENDING_AWARD_SUMMARY",
          "id": "1760800857309",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1760800857311_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a Supplier Negotiations pending award Advisor. Analize the provided negotiations that are pending to award {{$context.$nodes.SUPPLIER_NEGOTIATIONS.$output.items}}.\n\nFINAL OUTPUT\nUsing the previous analysis, for summarization, write exactly one friendly, plain-language sentence that explains why these negotiations are requiring attention for pending award, don't include specific information about the negotiations and don't list the negotiations. You can include the most critical negotiation requiring award.\n\n#Formatting Rules For Output\n -Must Generate the content in {{$context.$variables.Language}} language.\n -Output ONLY one sentence (no more than 80 words).\n -Do NOT include negotiation names, numbers, dates, counts, scores, or any specific fields.\n -Must refer to the item as \"negotiations\", don't use any other term.\n -Show all monetary amounts in {{$context.$variables.Currency}} currency and format the currency using {{$context.$variables.NumberFormat}} formatting style (for example, symbol placement, decimal separators, etc.).\n -Format all dates using {{$context.$variables.DateFormat}} date format and if there is time you can use this {{$context.$variables.TimeFormat}} time format."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "App Actions"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "InitDisplay": "1760801040515",
            "InitActions": "1770417592498"
          },
          "code": "APP_ACTIONS",
          "convergenceTargetId": "end",
          "id": "1760800876803",
          "inputs": [
            {
