              "id": "1765580612047_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You will display the information about the generated award recommendation coming from {{$context.$nodes.GET_AWARD_RECOMMENDATION.$output.items}}.\n\nYour output must be a messageListWidget where you will display the the awarded information per line, make sure to show information about savings comparing CurrentPrice and awarded ResponsePrice and infomation about who were the awarded suppliers.\n\n#Formatting Rules For Output\n -Must Generate the content in {{$context.$variables.Language}} language.\n -Show all monetary amounts in {{$context.$variables.Currency}} currency and format the currency using {{$context.$variables.NumberFormat}} formatting style (for example, symbol placement, decimal separators, etc.).\n -Format all dates using {{$context.$variables.DateFormat}} date format and if there is time you can use this {{$context.$variables.TimeFormat}} time format.\n -Accuracy: Do not assume or fabricate data that was not retrieved through the tools.\n -Conciseness: Keep responses brief, professional, and business-focused."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
