        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {
                "k": 0,
                "max_tokens": 32000,
                "p": 0.75
              },
              "code": "ORA_LLM_PREMIUM",
              "model": "OPEN_AI_GPT_4_1_MINI",
              "modelName": "GPT-4.1 mini",
              "provider": "CERT_PREMIUM"
            },
            "name": "Analize Negotiations"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1761003163169"
          },
          "code": "ANALIZE_NEGOTIATIONS",
          "id": "1770417592498",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770417592500_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "# ROLE\nYou are a Supplier Negotiations Advisor.\n\n# INPUT DATA\nYou will be provided with combined negotiation lists:\n{{$context.$nodes.MERGE_NEGOTIATION_DATA.$output.result}}\n\n# STRICT RULE: AVAILABLE FIELDS ONLY\nYou may ONLY use these fields for logic:\n- NegotiationStatus (string)\n- DifferenceInDays (number)\nYou may use AuctionHeaderId, NegotiationTitle, ProcurementBU, BuyerName, SuppliersCount, SupplierResponses, RestrictToInvitedSuppliersFlag ONLY for display text (TITLE/SUBTITLE/SUMMARY/ACTION), never for badge logic.\n\n# KEY INTERPRETATION (DO NOT GUESS)\nDifferenceInDays is ALWAYS \"how many days have passed since the trigger date for the given status\".\n\n# PHASE 1: BADGE ASSIGNMENT (USE ONLY NegotiationStatus + DifferenceInDays)\n\nA) If NegotiationStatus == \"CLOSED_AWARD_BY_DATE\":\n   - If DifferenceInDays < 0.0        => HIGH\n\nB) Else if NegotiationStatus == \"CLOSED\":\n   - If DifferenceInDays >= 3.0        => HIGH\n   - Else if DifferenceInDays >= 0   and  DifferenceInDays < 3.0 => MEDIUM\n   - Else                            => LOW\n\nC) Else:\n   - LOW\n\n# PHASE 2: SELECT TOP 5 (DIVERSITY + PRIORITY)\nSelect up to 5 UNIQUE items (unique by AuctionHeaderId; if missing, treat each input object as unique).\nDo NOT just sort everything and take first 5.\n\n1) Bucket A (Critical Awards):\n   - Candidates: badge == HIGH AND NegotiationStatus == \"CLOSED_AWARD_BY_DATE\"\n   - Sort: DifferenceInDays asc\n   - Select up to 3\n\n2) Bucket B (Critical Closed):\n   - If total selected < 5:\n   - Candidates: badge == HIGH AND NegotiationStatus == \"CLOSED\"\n   - Sort: DifferenceInDays desc\n   - Fill remaining slots\n\n3) Bucket C (Backfill):\n   - If total selected < 5: add remaining HIGH items (any status) not selected yet, sorted by DifferenceInDays desc\n   - If total selected < 5: add MEDIUM items not selected yet, sorted by DifferenceInDays desc\n   - If total selected < 5: add LOW items not selected yet, sorted by DifferenceInDays desc\nStop when you have 5 or no more items.\n\n# PHASE 3: FINAL SORT (SELECTED ONLY)\nSort selected items by:\n1) badge severity: HIGH, then MEDIUM, then LOW\n2) DifferenceInDays desc\n\n# OUTPUT GENERATION (messageListWidget entries)\nWidget Title:\n\"Attention Required\" (translate using formatting rules)\n\nFor each selected item:\n\nTITLE:\n\"<NegotiationTitle>\"\n\nSUBTITLE:\n\"<ProcurementBU> - <BuyerName>\"\n\nBADGE TEXT:\nUse the assigned badge (HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW). Translate using formatting rules.\n\nPriority:\nIf Badge is HIGH: priority must be alert.\nIf Badge is MEDIUM: priority must be warning.\nIf Badge is LOW: priority must be medium.\n\nTIMESTAMP:\nDo NOT display timestamp.\n\nSTATUS (choose exactly one; translate using formatting rules):\n- If NegotiationStatus == \"CLOSED_AWARD_BY_DATE\":\n  \"Award by date has already passed\"\n- If NegotiationStatus == \"CLOSED\":\n  \"Has been closed for [DifferenceInDays] days\"\n- Else:\n  \"Needs review\"\n\nSUMMARY (each sentence must be unique, translate using formatting rules):\n -Write one UNIQUE, friendly and detailed sentence explaining why the negotiation is at risk and generate a suggestion to the user to proceed with award process\n -Use the following attributes to indicate how many responses are submitted, if the negotiation is restricted to invited suppliers and the invited suppliers count: SupplierResponses, RestrictToInvitedSuppliersFlag, SuppliersCount.\n -If NegotiationStatus == \"CLOSED_AWARD_BY_DATE\" you must include AwardByDate.\n -If NegotiationStatus == \"CLOSED\" you must include CloseDate.\n\n\n\nACTION (do not translate the function name):\n- If badge == HIGH:\n  Use the critical action <Item.ApplyAward>\n\n# Formatting Rules For Output\n- Generate content in {{$context.$variables.Language}} language.\n- Conciseness: Keep responses brief, professional, and business-focused.\n- Show all monetary amounts in {{$context.$variables.Currency}} currency and format using {{$context.$variables.NumberFormat}}.\n- Format all dates using {{$context.$variables.DateFormat}}."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "businessObjectCode": "ORA_PRC_SOURCING_SUPPLIERNEGOTIATIONSAGENTIC",
            "functionName": "getall_supplierNegotiations_award_by_date",
            "name": "Get Award By Date Negotiations"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1771282444366"
          },
          "code": "GET_AWARD_BY_DATE_NEGOTIATIONS",
          "id": "1770845183825",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770845203254_1",
              "name": "Limit",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "5"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"items\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"AuctionHeaderId\": { \"type\": \"number\" },\n          \"Negotiation\":     { \"type\": \"number\" },\n          \"NegotiationType\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"NegotiationTitle\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"NegotiationStatus\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"NegotiationStatusCode\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"OpenDate\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"CloseDate\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"AwardByDate\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"CurrentDateTime\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"SuppliersCount\": { \"type\": \"number\" },\n          \"SupplierResponses\": { \"type\": \"number\" },\n          \"AwardStatus\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"NumberOfLines\": { \"type\": \"number\" },\n          \"ProcurementBUId\": { \"type\": \"number\" },\n          \"ProcurementBU\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"BuyerId\": { \"type\": \"number\" },\n          \"Buyer\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"AuctionHeaderId\",\n          \"Negotiation\",\n          \"NegotiationType\",\n          \"NegotiationTitle\",\n          \"NegotiationStatus\",\n          \"NegotiationStatusCode\",\n          \"OpenDate\",\n          \"CloseDate\",\n          \"AwardByDate\",\n          \"CurrentDateTime\",\n          \"SuppliersCount\",\n          \"SupplierResponses\",\n          \"AwardStatus\",\n          \"NumberOfLines\",\n          \"ProcurementBUId\",\n          \"ProcurementBU\",\n          \"BuyerId\",\n          \"Buyer\"\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"items\"]\n}",
          "type": "BO_FUNCTION"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Simplify Closed Negotiations Data",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "const rawList =  $context.$nodes.GET_SUPPLIER_NEGOTIATIONS_DATA.$output.items &&  $context.$nodes.GET_SUPPLIER_NEGOTIATIONS_DATA.$output.items ?  $context.$nodes.GET_SUPPLIER_NEGOTIATIONS_DATA.$output.items : ( $context.$nodes.GET_SUPPLIER_NEGOTIATIONS_DATA.$output.items || []);\n\nconst result = rawList.reduce((acc, item) => {\n\n    const created = new Date(item.CloseDate);\n    const now = new Date(item.CurrentDateTime);\n    const diffInMs = now - created;\n    const diffInDays = diffInMs / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24);\n    \n    if (!acc.seenIds.has(item.AuctionHeaderId)) { \n        acc.seenIds.add(item.AuctionHeaderId);\n\n   \n\n        acc.uniqueList.push({\n             AuctionHeaderId: item.AuctionHeaderId,\n             NegotiationStatus: item.NegotiationStatusCode,\n             CriticalAction: 'ora.Invoke(navigateToNegotiation,'+item.AuctionHeaderId+'-APPLY_AWARD)',\n             LowAction: 'ora.Invoke(navigateToNegotiation,'+item.AuctionHeaderId+'-NO_ACTION)',\n             ApplyAward: 'ora.Invoke(applyRecommendedAward,awardNegotiation-'+item.AuctionHeaderId+')',\n             DifferenceInDays: diffInDays,\n             ProcurementBU: item.ProcurementBU,\n             SupplierResponses: item.SupplierResponses,\n             CloseDate: item.CloseDate,\n             AwardByDate: item.AwardByDate,\n             SuppliersCount: item.SuppliersCount,\n             RestrictToInvitedSuppliersFlag: item.RestrictToInvitedSuppliersFlag,\n             NegotiationTitle: item.NegotiationType + ' '+ item.Negotiation+ ' - '+ (item.NegotiationTitle || \" \"),\n             BuyerName: item.Buyer || \" \"\n        });\n    }\n\n    return acc;\n\n}, { seenIds: new Set(), uniqueList: [] }); \n\nlet obj= {\n    NegotiationsList: result.uniqueList,\n    NegotiationsCount: result.uniqueList.length\n\n  };\n\n \n  return obj;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1770845183825"
          },
          "code": "SIMPLIFY_CLOSED_NEGOTIATIONS_DATA",
          "id": "1771275362680",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Simplify Award By Date Data",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "const rawList =  $context.$nodes.GET_AWARD_BY_DATE_NEGOTIATIONS.$output.items &&  $context.$nodes.GET_AWARD_BY_DATE_NEGOTIATIONS.$output.items ?  $context.$nodes.GET_AWARD_BY_DATE_NEGOTIATIONS.$output.items : ( $context.$nodes.GET_AWARD_BY_DATE_NEGOTIATIONS.$output.items || []);\n\nconst result = rawList.reduce((acc, item) => {\n\n\n   if(item.AwardByDate!=null){\n\n      const created = new Date(item.AwardByDate);\n      const now = new Date(item.CurrentDateTime);\n      const diffInMs = created - now;\n      const diffInDays = diffInMs / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24);\n    \n      if (!acc.seenIds.has(item.AuctionHeaderId) && diffInDays<0) { \n          acc.seenIds.add(item.AuctionHeaderId);\n\n   \n\n          acc.uniqueList.push({\n               AuctionHeaderId: item.AuctionHeaderId,\n               NegotiationStatus: item.NegotiationStatusCode + '_AWARD_BY_DATE',\n               DifferenceInDays: diffInDays,\n               CriticalAction: 'ora.Invoke(navigateToNegotiation,'+item.AuctionHeaderId+'-APPLY_AWARD)',\n               LowAction: 'ora.Invoke(navigateToNegotiation,'+item.AuctionHeaderId+'-NO_ACTION)',\n               ApplyAward: 'ora.Invoke(applyRecommendedAward,awardNegotiation-'+item.AuctionHeaderId+')',\n               ProcurementBU: item.ProcurementBU,\n               SupplierResponses: item.SupplierResponses,\n               CloseDate: item.CloseDate,\n               AwardByDate: item.AwardByDate,\n               SuppliersCount: item.SuppliersCount,\n               RestrictToInvitedSuppliersFlag: item.RestrictToInvitedSuppliersFlag,\n               NegotiationTitle: item.NegotiationType + ' '+ item.Negotiation+ ' - '+ (item.NegotiationTitle || \" \"),\n               BuyerName: item.Buyer || \" \"\n          });\n      }\n    }\n\n    return acc;\n\n}, { seenIds: new Set(), uniqueList: [] }); \n\nlet obj= {\n    NegotiationsList: result.uniqueList,\n    NegotiationsCount: result.uniqueList.length\n\n  };\n\n \n  return obj;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1760800487530"
          },
          "code": "SIMPLIFY_AWARD_BY_DATE_DATA",
          "id": "1771282444366",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Merge Negotiation Data",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "const sources = [\n   $context.$nodes.SIMPLIFY_CLOSED_NEGOTIATIONS_DATA.$output.result,\n   $context.$nodes.SIMPLIFY_AWARD_BY_DATE_DATA.$output.result\n];\n\nconst result = sources.reduce((acc, sourceObj) => {\n    \n    const currentList = sourceObj.NegotiationsList || [];\n\n    currentList.forEach(item => {\n        if (item.AuctionHeaderId && !acc.seenIds.has(item.AuctionHeaderId)) {\n            acc.seenIds.add(item.AuctionHeaderId);\n            acc.mergedList.push(item);\n        }\n    });\n\n    return acc;\n\n}, { seenIds: new Set(), mergedList: [] });\n\nlet obj = {\n    NegotiationsList: result.mergedList,\n    NegotiationsCount: result.mergedList.length\n};\nreturn obj ;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1760800876803"
          },
          "code": "MERGE_NEGOTIATION_DATA",
          "id": "1771282557004",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        }
      ],
